      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): asset selection, the catalog check and the heavy filter read directory suites\n\n- assets::suites_for reads the entry file and each module file of a suite.\n- catalog::map_catalog finds the catalog suite with suites::entry.\n- plan::may_run_ignored walks all module files of a directory suite; a\n  mod line alone no longer plans a heavy step. A missing module file, a\n  walk error, include! and #[path] still plan it. Flat suites keep the old\n  rule (#3706).\n- suites::sources_and_missing counts declared modules whose file is absent.\n\nThe quick <submod>:: filter is #3706.\n\nRefs #3186\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
